// Fourth player-authored RapidRanged spell in this folder (see
// eldritch_blast.ron for the full write-up of the variant's real behavior:
// every projectile travels the same look_dir, no per-projectile aim/spread).
//
// Sheet deviations, both documented rather than silently dropped:
// - `range: Self` in the sheet describes where the orbiting motes are
//   conjured (around the caster), not the reach of an individual mote once
//   flung -- the actual attack is a direct-fire ranged burst, same shape as
//   this folder's other RapidRanged spells, so the compendium `range` is
//   set to the motes' real projectile reach instead of `SelfOnly`.
// - `duration: Concentration(60)` / "launches one or two meteors per turn
//   for the duration" describes a persistent conjuration re-fired every
//   subsequent turn. RapidRanged has no persistent/re-triggerable state --
//   `common/src/states/rapid_ranged.rs` fires its whole burst once per cast
//   and returns to Recover -- so this ships as a single two-meteor burst
//   per cast (matching eldritch_blast's own fixed-2 precedent for "one or
//   two"), not a sustained per-turn recast. The concentration duration is
//   dropped, not modeled.
//
// Circle 3, scaled up from eldritch_blast (circle 0: 2 motes, 8 dmg/mote,
// 0 energy/mote) and wayward_force_darts (circle 1: 3 darts, 6 dmg/dart,
// 10 energy/dart) -- 2 motes, 15 dmg/mote (30 total), 22 energy/mote (44
// total). Flagged for wave-close-out balance review.
RapidRanged(
    energy_cost: 22,
    buildup_duration: 0.4,
    shoot_duration: 0.05,
    recover_duration: 0.35,
    options: (
        max_projectiles: Some(2),
        fire_all: true,
    ),
    projectile: (
        kind: Simple,
        attack: Some((
            damage: 15,
            damage_kind: Fire,
        )),
    ),
    projectile_body: Object(BoltFire),
    projectile_speed: 75.0,
    meta: (school: Some(Evocation), source: Some(Arcane)),
)
